{"id":3641,"slug":"3641-controlvalueaccessor-dung-khi-nao","category":"Angular","subcategory":"Forms","level":"advanced","question_vi":"ControlValueAccessor dùng khi nào?","question_en":"When should you use ControlValueAccessor?","answer_vi":"ControlValueAccessor là adapter giữa Angular Forms API và custom UI component.\n\nSkeleton tối thiểu:\n```typescript\nexport class RatingInput implements ControlValueAccessor {\n  value = 0\n  disabled = false\n  private onChange = (value: number) => {}\n  private onTouched = () => {}\n\n  writeValue(value: number) { this.value = value }\n  registerOnChange(fn: (value: number) => void) { this.onChange = fn }\n  registerOnTouched(fn: () => void) { this.onTouched = fn }\n  setDisabledState(disabled: boolean) { this.disabled = disabled }\n}\n```\nLỗi phổ biến là emit change trong `writeValue`, gây loop.","answer_en":"ControlValueAccessor is the adapter between Angular Forms API and a custom UI component.\n\nMinimal skeleton:\n```typescript\nexport class RatingInput implements ControlValueAccessor {\n  value = 0\n  disabled = false\n  private onChange = (value: number) => {}\n  private onTouched = () => {}\n\n  writeValue(value: number) { this.value = value }\n  registerOnChange(fn: (value: number) => void) { this.onChange = fn }\n  registerOnTouched(fn: () => void) { this.onTouched = fn }\n  setDisabledState(disabled: boolean) { this.disabled = disabled }\n}\n```\nA common bug is emitting change from `writeValue`, which creates loops.","answer_html_vi":"<p class=\"qa-summary\">ControlValueAccessor là adapter giữa Angular Forms API và custom UI component.</p><p class=\"qa-detail\">Skeleton tối thiểu:</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">typescript</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"export class RatingInput implements ControlValueAccessor {\n  value = 0\n  disabled = false\n  private onChange = (value: number) =&gt; {}\n  private onTouched = () =&gt; {}\n\n  writeValue(value: number) { this.value = value }\n  registerOnChange(fn: (value: number) =&gt; void) { this.onChange = fn }\n  registerOnTouched(fn: () =&gt; void) { this.onTouched = fn }\n  setDisabledState(disabled: boolean) { this.disabled = disabled }\n}\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">export</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">RatingInput</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">implements</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">ControlValueAccessor</span> {\n  value = <span class=\"hljs-number\">0</span>\n  disabled = <span class=\"hljs-literal\">false</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">private</span> onChange = <span class=\"hljs-function\">(<span class=\"hljs-params\"><span class=\"hljs-attr\">value</span>: <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">number</span></span>) =&gt;</span> {}\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">private</span> onTouched = <span class=\"hljs-function\">() =&gt;</span> {}\n\n  <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">writeValue</span>(<span class=\"hljs-params\"><span class=\"hljs-attr\">value</span>: <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">number</span></span>) { <span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">this</span>.<span class=\"hljs-property\">value</span> = value }\n  <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">registerOnChange</span>(<span class=\"hljs-params\"><span class=\"hljs-attr\">fn</span>: (value: <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">number</span>) =&gt; <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">void</span></span>) { <span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">this</span>.<span class=\"hljs-property\">onChange</span> = fn }\n  <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">registerOnTouched</span>(<span class=\"hljs-params\"><span class=\"hljs-attr\">fn</span>: () =&gt; <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">void</span></span>) { <span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">this</span>.<span class=\"hljs-property\">onTouched</span> = fn }\n  <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">setDisabledState</span>(<span class=\"hljs-params\"><span class=\"hljs-attr\">disabled</span>: <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">boolean</span></span>) { <span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">this</span>.<span class=\"hljs-property\">disabled</span> = disabled }\n}</code></pre></div><p>Lỗi phổ biến là emit change trong <code>writeValue</code>, gây loop.</p>","answer_html_en":"<p class=\"qa-summary\">ControlValueAccessor is the adapter between Angular Forms API and a custom UI component.</p><p class=\"qa-detail\">Minimal skeleton:</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">typescript</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"export class RatingInput implements ControlValueAccessor {\n  value = 0\n  disabled = false\n  private onChange = (value: number) =&gt; {}\n  private onTouched = () =&gt; {}\n\n  writeValue(value: number) { this.value = value }\n  registerOnChange(fn: (value: number) =&gt; void) { this.onChange = fn }\n  registerOnTouched(fn: () =&gt; void) { this.onTouched = fn }\n  setDisabledState(disabled: boolean) { this.disabled = disabled }\n}\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">export</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">RatingInput</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">implements</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">ControlValueAccessor</span> {\n  value = <span class=\"hljs-number\">0</span>\n  disabled = <span class=\"hljs-literal\">false</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">private</span> onChange = <span class=\"hljs-function\">(<span class=\"hljs-params\"><span class=\"hljs-attr\">value</span>: <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">number</span></span>) =&gt;</span> {}\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">private</span> onTouched = <span class=\"hljs-function\">() =&gt;</span> {}\n\n  <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">writeValue</span>(<span class=\"hljs-params\"><span class=\"hljs-attr\">value</span>: <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">number</span></span>) { <span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">this</span>.<span class=\"hljs-property\">value</span> = value }\n  <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">registerOnChange</span>(<span class=\"hljs-params\"><span class=\"hljs-attr\">fn</span>: (value: <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">number</span>) =&gt; <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">void</span></span>) { <span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">this</span>.<span class=\"hljs-property\">onChange</span> = fn }\n  <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">registerOnTouched</span>(<span class=\"hljs-params\"><span class=\"hljs-attr\">fn</span>: () =&gt; <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">void</span></span>) { <span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">this</span>.<span class=\"hljs-property\">onTouched</span> = fn }\n  <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">setDisabledState</span>(<span class=\"hljs-params\"><span class=\"hljs-attr\">disabled</span>: <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">boolean</span></span>) { <span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">this</span>.<span class=\"hljs-property\">disabled</span> = disabled }\n}</code></pre></div><p>A common bug is emitting change from <code>writeValue</code>, which creates loops.</p>","references":[],"related":[{"url":"/q/3600-angular-la-gi-khac-angularjs-react-va-vue-nhu-the-nao","title":"Angular là gì? Khác AngularJS, React và Vue như thế nào?"},{"url":"/q/3601-component-trong-angular-gom-nhung-phan-nao","title":"Component trong Angular gồm những phần nào?"},{"url":"/q/3602-standalone-component-la-gi-va-tai-sao-angular-khuyen-nghi-dung","title":"Standalone component là gì và tại sao Angular khuyến nghị dùng?"},{"url":"/q/3603-angular-application-bootstrap-hien-dai-hoat-dong-nhu-the-nao","title":"Angular application bootstrap hiện đại hoạt động như thế nào?"},{"url":"/q/3604-ngmodule-con-vai-tro-gi-trong-angular-hien-dai","title":"NgModule còn vai trò gì trong Angular hiện đại?"},{"url":"/q/3605-lifecycle-hooks-trong-angular-chay-theo-thu-tu-nao-va-dung-khi-nao","title":"Lifecycle hooks trong Angular chạy theo thứ tự nào và dùng khi nào?"},{"url":"/q/3606-angular-compiler-va-template-type-checking-giup-gi-cho-production-app","title":"Angular compiler và template type checking giúp gì cho production app?"},{"url":"/q/3607-interpolation-property-binding-va-event-binding-khac-nhau-the-nao","title":"Interpolation, property binding và event binding khác nhau thế nào?"}]}